SUMMARY:The Saturday Autumn Colours Ashbridges Bay- Walk\, Talk and Good T
 imes!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\n\\*Please read
  carefully\\*\n\nLooking to enjoy the beautiful colours of autumn\, have s
 ome great conversations and meet new people? Join us for a relaxed Saturda
 y walk through Ashbridges Bay! We’ll take in the waterfront scenery\, en
 joy the fresh air and create plenty of opportunities to talk\, laugh and m
 ake new friends along the way. Come by yourself or bring a friend—either
  way\, you’ll receive a warm welcome!\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups to
 o :)\n\n**Arrive between 2:30 pm and 3:00 pm**\n\n**Where to meet us:**\n\
 nMeetup us outside **Woodbine Station beside bike racks**\n**The Main Wood
 bine Station Entrance:** Located at the southeast corner of Woodbine Avenu
 e and Strathmore Boulevard.\n\nWe will walk as a group from the station do
 wn to Ashbridges Bay\n\\*Most will stick around after for a bite to eat\, 
 ice cream and/or a beverage to sip on :)\n\nFurther details below:\n\nSinc
 erely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n**Event Details:**\n**The S
 aturday Autumn Colours Ashbridges Bay- Walk\, Talk and Good Times!**\n\nWh
 at to expect:\n\n* A relaxed walk along the Ashbridges Bay waterfront\n* I
 ce breaker games to get to know one another\n* Plenty of opportunities to 
 mix\, mingle and meet new people\n* A comfortable pace that allows everyon
 e to walk and talk\n* Beautiful views of the lake\, beach\, parkland and s
 urrounding area\n* A positive atmosphere for both newcomers and returning 
 members\n\nPlease wear comfortable walking shoes and bring water\, sunscre
 en or anything else you may need for the weather. The purpose of this even
 t is simple: get outside\, enjoy the day and make a few new connections!\n
 \\* Many of us will hit a local pub/restaurant after the walk for dinner a
 nd beverages- plan to join us for that if you can\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n10 d
 ollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\nor e transfer in adv
 ance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:Steveflemming11@gmail.com)\n\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nPark
 ing near Woodbine Station:\n(Although I encourage you to take subway if yo
 u can)
