SUMMARY:The Saturday Night Rock\, Dance and Good Times with Friends!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nGet ready for 
 a Saturday night of live music\, dancing\, classic rock and good times wit
 h friends!\n\nWe’re heading to Smoke Show in Toronto for a night with Ru
 de E Bones\, a high-energy GTA cover band bringing classic rock favourites
  and dance-floor rock hits to the stage.\n\nExpect the kind of music that 
 gets people singing along\, moving onto the dance floor and remembering ju
 st how much fun a great Saturday night can be. Whether you come to dance\,
  enjoy the band\, meet some new people\, or simply have a drink and hang o
 ut with friends\, you’re very welcome to join us.\n\n\\*Joined by my oth
 er groups too :)\n\nEvent details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\
 n(Organizer/Host)\n──────────────────
 ──────\nEVENT DETAILS\n**The Saturday Night Rock\, Dance and G
 ood Times with Friends!**\nHosted by Steve Flemming\n\nDate: Saturday\, Oc
 tober 17\nLocation: Smoke Show\nCity: Toronto\, Ontario\n\n🎸 LIVE MUSIC
 : Rude E Bones\n🎶 Classic Rock • Rock Favourites • Dance-Floor Hits
 \n💃 Dancing\n🍻 Drinks and Food Available\n🎉 Socializing and Good 
 Times\n👋 New Members and Solo Attendees Welcome\nThis is a social night
  first and foremost. Come meet some people\, enjoy the music\, have a drin
 k\, hit the dance floor—or do all four!\n──────────
 ──────────────\n**FRIENDLY REMINDERS**\n• Pl
 ease be respectful and friendly toward everyone attending\n• If you RSVP
 \, please do your best to attend or update your RSVP if your plans change\
 n• Food and beverages are purchased individually from the venue\n• Ple
 ase drink responsibly and arrange safe transportation home\n• Look for S
 teve and the Meetup group when you arrive\n• Most importantly—come rea
 dy for some great music and a fun Saturday night!\n\n**Event Fee**: $10 at
  the door (cash only) or in advance by e-transfer to [steveflemming11@gmai
 l.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\nPlease mention that you are with
  Steve's group when you arrive.\nArrival Time: Please arrive between 8:30 
 PM and 10:00 PM.\n\n**Parking:**\nParking on street and free parking found
  in residential area and on Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton
