SUMMARY:Toronto Raptors Season Home Opener Watch Party! 🏀 Raptors vs. C
 hicago Bulls
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nBasketball is 
 back\, and what better way to celebrate than getting together to watch the
  **Toronto Raptors** take on the Chicago Bulls in their regular season hom
 e opener!\n\nJoin us for a fun Wednesday evening at **The Pheasant**\, whe
 re we'll enjoy the game on some great big-screen TVs\, along with good foo
 d\, drinks\, conversation and plenty of Raptors spirit!\n\nWhether you're 
 a passionate basketball fan or simply enjoy a lively social atmosphere\, t
 his is a great opportunity to meet new people\, catch up with friends and 
 cheer on our hometown team!\nComing on your own? Even better! It's a wonde
 rful opportunity to meet fellow Raptors fans and make some new friends.\n\
 nJoined by my other groups too! :)\n\nDetails below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSte
 ve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nSoul City Social Club\n\n***\n\nEVENT DETAI
 LS\n\nTORONTO RAPTORS SEASON HOME OPENER WATCH PARTY!\n\nToronto Raptors v
 s. Chicago Bulls\nWednesday\, October 21\, 2026 — 7:00 PM\nHosted by Ste
 ve Flemming — Soul City Social Club\nLocation: The Pheasant: A Firkin Pu
 b\n1999 Avenue Road\, Toronto\n(Please mention Steve with Meetup when you 
 arrive.)\nFree Parking in Residential area\n\nGame: Toronto Raptors vs. Ch
 icago Bulls — Season Home Opener\n\n**Admission Fee:** $2 per person\, p
 ayable in cash at the door or by e-transfer in advance to steveflemming11@
 gmail.com\n\nFood & Drinks: Food and drink specials available. Everyone is
  responsible for their own purchases.\n\n***\n\nLet's enjoy a great evenin
 g of basketball\, friendship\, laughter and some good old-fashioned Toront
 o Raptors excitement!\n\nLooking forward to seeing everyone there!\n\nGo R
 aptors Go! 🏀
